# Floor plan assignment

- Three input tiers: photos, video, LiDAR. One FloorPlan IR: `docs/schemas/floorplan.schema.json`.
- Linux Cloud Agents cannot run Apple RoomPlan. Ingest JSON/USDZ/PLY exports.
- Monocular SfM has no metric scale. Photos without a prior must use `units: relative` plus `missing_scale`.
- Prefer classical geometry over an LLM that guesses dimensions.
- ESX/Xactimate export is out of scope unless `docs/takehome.md` requires it.
- Tests must run headless (`opencv-python-headless`).
